Minehaul UI includes geometry and motion adapted from the EVE Frontier
Builders Program UI kit (https://github.com/evefrontier/eve-frontier-builders-program,
web/components/ui at commit ca43886): the Plate clip-path and inset keyline,
the Button keyline sweep and loading cells, the interlocking seam used by the
lifecycle track and navigation, and the technique of drawing icons as strings
of grid cells compiled to one SVG path (the glyphs themselves are new). Those
portions are used under the following licence:

